msgid "Sets the maximum number of times the EKF2 will be allowed to reset its yaw to the estimate from the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator\\. No resets will be allowed unless the use of the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimate is enabled via the EK2\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK parameter\\."
