#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:53836
#: 0669e1145a834649a64bce6e659fa7f4
msgid "Range finder can be used as the primary height source when below this percentage of its maximum range \\(see RNGFNDx\\_MAX\\) and the primary height source is Baro or GPS \\(see EK3\\_SRCx\\_POSZ\\)\\.  This feature should not be used for terrain following as it is designed for vertical takeoff and landing with climb above the range finder use height before commencing the mission\\, and with horizontal position changes below that height being limited to a flat region around the takeoff and landing point\\."
